              </span>
              <h3 class="text-[15px] font-bold text-white mt-1">
                Daun Jagung Tegap Kaku 45° & Spora Bulai Gagal Tembus!
              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="p-3 text-[12px] text-slate-600 leading-snug">
            Melapisi daun jagung muda sejak umur 10–15 HST dengan kristal silika sehingga spora <em>Peronosclerospora</em> terpental dan tanaman tumbuh hijau royo-royo.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-emerald-200/80 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <div class="relative aspect-[3/2] w-full bg-slate-900">
            <img
              src="/images/landing/perisai-silika-bulai-jagung-cabai/overclaim-2.webp"
              alt="Tanaman cabai umur 40 HST pucuk daun mekar mulus kaku tahan keriting Thrips dan Kutu Kebul"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              width="960"
              height="644"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/90 via-slate-950/50 to-transparent px-3.5 pb-2.5 pt-6">
              <span class="inline-block rounded bg-emerald-600 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-white">
                EFEK 2 • CABAI 40 HST TAHAN KERITING
              </span>
