          </div>
          <p class="p-3 text-[12px] text-slate-600 leading-snug">
            Mengeraskan jaringan epidermis pucuk cabai sehingga hama penusuk-pengisap vektor virus kuning tidak sanggup menembus cairan sel daun.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-emerald-200/80 bg-white shadow-sm">
          <div class="relative aspect-[3/2] w-full bg-slate-900">
            <img
              src="/images/landing/perisai-silika-bulai-jagung-cabai/overclaim-3.webp"
              alt="Buah cabai merah mulus mengkilap bebas patek dan tongkol jagung besar padat"
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              width="960"
              height="644"
              loading="lazy"
